= Packaging multi-plateforme
Wheels nécessaires :

- #strong[manylinux] (glibc), #strong[musllinux] (Alpine)
- #strong[macOS] universal2 (arm64 + x86\_64)
- #strong[Windows] (x86\_64, arm64)

