# .github/workflows/release.yml
- uses: PyO3/maturin-action@v1
  with:
    target: ${{ matrix.target }}
    args: --release --out dist
    manylinux: auto
- run: maturin upload --skip-existing dist/*
```

→ `maturin-action` orchestre le cross-compile + upload PyPI.

